			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Canonicalize path resolution in ConfigurationProvider\n\nUpdate the import structure in `ConfigurationProvider/Loading.rs` and `ConfigurationProvider/UpdateValue.rs` to use the explicit nested path resolution for `ApplicationRunTime`. Replace the deprecated `RuntimeStruct::ApplicationRunTime` with the flattened canonical path `ApplicationRunTime::ApplicationRunTime`, aligning with the recent module flattening strategy applied to `ExtensionState` and `ConfigurationState`.\n\nAdditionally, correct the type signature in `collect_default_configurations` to reference the fully qualified canonical path `ApplicationState::State::ApplicationState::ApplicationState`. This ensures consistent symbol resolution across the `Mountain` backend and adheres to the project's strict PascalCase naming conventions for module hierarchies.",
